q=A.pv(h,"ApproveRx is a pharmaceutical ordering and inventory management application that enables users to browse products, place orders, and manage day-to-day sales operations efficiently. My primary contribution involved upgrading the user interface, redesigning multiple screens, integrating updated APIs, and enhancing overall application usability and performance.\n\nThe application now offers a more modern user experience, faster data loading through paginated APIs, and barcode scanning capabilities for quicker product search and order processing.",A.b(["UI/UX ENHANCEMENT","Redesigned and modernized multiple application screens","Improved user experience and visual consistency","Created and implemented new screen designs","","API INTEGRATION","Integrated updated backend APIs","Refactored data flows for improved maintainability","","PAGINATION IMPLEMENTATION","Implemented server-side pagination for product listings","Improved performance and reduced loading times","",g,"Added mobile barcode scanning functionality","Quick product search and identification through barcode scanning","","PERFORMANCE IMPROVEMENTS","Optimized API calls and screen rendering","Enhanced responsiveness across the application"],e),"assets/images/approveRx_logo_new.png",h,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.arhamcorp.approverx&pcampaignid=web_share",[],q,"ApproveRx",h)
p=A.b(["Flutter","REST APIs","Firebase",j,"GetX"],e)
p=A.pv(h,"Arham POS is a retail billing and management application built for pharmacies, retailers, and other businesses to handle everyday sales and store operations. It brings billing, product and inventory management, customer records, payments, barcode scanning, and transaction reporting together in a single platform.\n\nBuilt with Flutter, the application delivers a fast and user-friendly interface for processing sales and managing products across multiple stores. It connects with backend services to keep business data synchronized and includes capabilities such as barcode-based billing, Bluetooth receipt printing, payment gateway integration, multi-branch support, role-based access control, and real-time inventory updates.",A.b(["BILLING & SALES","Create and process retail sales transactions","Generate invoices and manage billing workflows","View and manage sales history and transaction details","",g,"Scan product barcodes for quick product identification","Add scanned products directly to the billing cart","Speed up checkout and reduce manual product entry","","PRODUCT & INVENTORY MANAGEMENT","Search and manage products available for sale","Track product stock and inventory levels","Automatically update inventory after sales transactions","","CUSTOMER MANAGEMENT","Create and manage customer records","Select customers during billing transactions","Maintain customer-wise sales and transaction history","","PAYMENT MANAGEMENT","Support multiple payment methods during checkout","Integrated payment gateway for digital transactions","Record and track payment details for completed sales","","RECEIPT & PRINTING","Generate receipts for completed transactions","Bluetooth receipt printer integration","Support quick and convenient receipt printing at checkout","","MULTI-BRANCH MANAGEMENT","Manage sales and inventory across multiple branches","Maintain branch-specific product and transaction data","Support centralized business operations across different locations","","USER & ROLE MANAGEMENT","Role-based access control for different users","Manage user permissions according to responsibilities","Restrict access to sensitive business operations and data","","SALES REPORTING","View detailed sales and transaction reports","Track sales performance and business activity","Access transaction data for analysis and record keeping","","API INTEGRATION","Integrated REST APIs for sales, products, customers, and inventory","Synchronize transaction and business data with backend services","Optimized API communication for faster data retrieval and updates","","UI/UX DEVELOPMENT","Designed and modernized major application screens","Built responsive interfaces for smooth retail workflows","Improved navigation, usability, and overall application experience","",i,"Optimized data loading and API-driven operations","Reduced unnecessary network requests and improved response times","Enhanced overall application stability and performance"],e),"assets/images/arham_pos_logo.png",h,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.arhampos.app&pcampaignid=web_share",[],p,"Arham POS","https://app.arhamcorp.in/")
o=A.b(["Flutter","Firebase Auth","Cloud Firestore","SQLite",j],e)
o=A.pv(h,"PeakFit is a cross-platform fitness app built with Flutter that helps users log workouts, follow personalized training plans, and track calories burned. It supports various workout categories like strength, cardio, and flexibility, with customizable exercises and real-time progress analytics.\n\nThe app adapts to all fitness levels and syncs user data securely using Firebase, ensuring seamless performance on both Android and iOS devices.",A.b(["PROFILE CREATION & PERSONALIZATION","Collects user data: age, gender, height, weight, and activity level","Calculates daily calorie needs and BMR based on user input","","STEP COUNTER","Tracks steps in real-time using device sensors","Displays daily progress towards step goals","","CALORIE & MACRONUTRIENT TRACKER","Allows manual logging of meals","Automatically calculates calories and macronutrients (carbs, protein, fats)","","WORKOUT TRACKER","Enables manual logging of exercises, sets, reps, and weights","Stores workout history for progress tracking","","SMART RECOMMENDATIONS","Provides personalized workout and diet suggestions based on goals","Updates recommendations as user data evolves"],e),"assets/images/peakfit_icon.png",h,h,["assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/signup.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/login.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/gender_selection.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/age_selection.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/weight_selection.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/goal_selection.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/level_selection.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/home_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/workout_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/diet_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/profile.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/food_category.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/workout_history.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/peakfit/diet_history.jpg"],o,"PeakFit - Fitness Tracker",h)
